248
00:14:37,660 --> 00:14:39,040
A direct hit!

249
00:14:40,540 --> 00:14:44,057
Your little rainstorm didn't save
you from that one, now did it?

250
00:14:44,140 --> 00:14:45,377
Your night is toast!

251
00:14:45,460 --> 00:14:48,700
and you're almost out of life points.

252
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:50,376
Yugi, keep fighting.

253
00:14:50,620 --> 00:14:51,797
You can come back from this.

254
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:53,300
You're all delusional.

255
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:54,860
No, Joey's right.

256
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:59,140
Yugi never gives up, and we never
give up on him. You're nuts.

257
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:02,857
Weevil has totally annihilated
Yugi's strongest monster combo.

258
00:15:02,940 --> 00:15:05,280
He's down to 50 measly life points.

259
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:08,284
He can't win, so do me a
favor and stop yapping.

260
00:15:08,540 --> 00:15:13,187
I won't stop yapping, you selfish, pompous,
bleach-blonde, know-it-all win bag.

261
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:15,873
Do us a favor and get lost, right, Joey?

262
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:16,880
You said it.

263
00:15:17,300 --> 00:15:18,594
Just ignore her, Teya.

264
00:15:18,980 --> 00:15:19,957
Yugi's in trouble.

265
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:20,870
I know.

266
00:15:20,953 --> 00:15:21,783
What can we do?

267
00:15:21,866 --> 00:15:22,696
I don't know.

268
00:15:22,779 --> 00:15:26,111
But it'd be great if we could
trade Mai in for life points.

269
00:15:26,620 --> 00:15:27,500
I wish.

270
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:32,181
I told you all along Yugi never
had a chance at winning this thing.

271
00:15:32,300 --> 00:15:35,535
He wastes too much of his
time listening to you losers.

272
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:37,277
Weevil keeps his mind on the game.

273
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:39,357
Then why didn't he see this coming?

274
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,500
See what coming?

275
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:43,496
Whatever it is Yugi's grinning about.

276
00:15:44,860 --> 00:15:45,740
You're right.

277
00:15:45,980 --> 00:15:47,400
He's got a big smile.

278
00:15:49,940 --> 00:15:51,120
He's not smiling.

279
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:52,594
I think he's laughing.

280
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:53,680
No way.

281
00:15:56,740 --> 00:15:57,840
Hey, hey!

282
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,597
What are you so happy about?

283
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:01,080
Stop that snickering!

284
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:06,360
Weevil, I know it will be very difficult
for you to accept losing a duel.

285
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:12,377
Especially after spending so much time
finding inventive ways to cheat But

286
00:16:12,460 --> 00:16:16,757
if you thought bending the rules would
help you win this match You're wrong

287
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:17,670
No,

288
00:16:17,753 --> 00:16:20,417
this is a trick You play
dishonestly so you expect

289
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:23,197
the same of your opponents
But I duel with Honor

290
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:26,297
Weevil and that makes all
the difference You got

291
00:16:26,380 --> 00:16:31,380
nothing Here's what I've got
The mighty Summoned Skull

292
00:16:42,660 --> 00:16:44,280
Whoa, what's that?

293
00:16:44,700 --> 00:16:45,797
This is it, Weevil.

294
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:48,939
Your ultimate insect won't
withstand my next attack.

295
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:50,630
Ha!

296
00:16:50,713 --> 00:16:51,880
Yugi must be losing it.

297
00:16:52,060 --> 00:16:56,020
His summoned skull is strong, but
my great moth is stronger still.

298
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,077
If he's foolish enough to attack,

299
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:01,297
my monster will most certainly
squish his monster and

300
00:17:01,380 --> 00:17:04,733
wipe out the rest of Yugi's
precious life points as well.

301
00:17:05,460 --> 00:17:07,817
There's something you overlooked, Weevil.

302
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:11,260
My magical mist is still
dampening this entire field.

303
00:17:12,660 --> 00:17:13,740
He's right!

304
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:18,940
Everything's wet!

305
00:17:19,220 --> 00:17:22,020
My great morph is totally soaked!

306
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:26,140
And my summoned skull
attacks with electricity,

307
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:30,000
making your waterlogged bug
a giant-sized lightning rod.

308
00:17:30,260 --> 00:17:32,257
I hope you're in the
mood for some fireworks,

309
00:17:32,340 --> 00:17:33,170
Weevil,

310
00:17:33,253 --> 00:17:37,480
because all this water boosts my monster's
electrical attack by 1,000 points.

311
00:17:38,420 --> 00:17:39,900
Summon Skull!

312
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:41,580
Lightning Strike!

313
00:17:58,260 --> 00:17:59,380
It's over.

314
00:17:59,700 --> 00:18:00,620
I've won.

315
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,640
No! Impossible!

316
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:05,380
My morph's unbeatable!

317
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:10,240
All right, Yugi! Way to go! Yeah!

318
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,340
You won!

319
00:18:12,600 --> 00:18:13,740
I knew you would!

320
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:16,790
Impressive.

321
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:19,680
I didn't think Yugi
could ever beat Weevil.

322
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:25,560
But I'm the regional champion!

323
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:26,737
The regional champion!

324
00:18:26,820 --> 00:18:29,320
You call yourself a champion,

325
00:18:29,520 --> 00:18:32,577
Weevil, but you only won your
duels through lying and cheating.

326
00:18:32,660 --> 00:18:33,542
True champions.

327
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,460
They play with honor.

328
00:18:36,100 --> 00:18:37,680
They play fair.

329
00:18:38,020 --> 00:18:40,477
Don't waste your breath
on this sneaky slug.

330
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:41,972
He's a duel in disgrace.

331
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:45,440
And I hereby relieve him
of his dueling gauntlet.

332
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:51,150
There.

333
00:18:51,560 --> 00:18:53,360
Three star chips so far.

334
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:56,600
But I still need to win seven more.

335
00:18:56,820 --> 00:19:00,917
Ten starships will gain me entry into
that castle where they're holding

336
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:05,840
my grandfather prisoner and where
I'll battle Pegasus once and for all.
